      "text": "The equation shows the overall reaction between an amine and an acid chloride."
    },
    {
      "type": "equation",
      "latex": "2\\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{NH}_2 + \\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{COCl} \\rightarrow \\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{CONHCH}_2\\text{CH}_3 + \\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{NH}_3\\text{Cl}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The four steps in the mechanism are as follows."
    },
    {
